# lantern-keeper

Phone-first idle game: keep a lighthouse lamp lit through the night so the ships get home.
Plain JavaScript modules, no build step.

## Rules

- No dependencies in package.json: the game is plain files.
- Save data is versioned (`src/save.js`, currently v1). Changing its shape means bumping
  `SAVE_VERSION` and adding a migration.

## Layout

- `src/render.js` — draws everything into one `<canvas>`.
- `src/lamp.js` — oil and light rules.
- `src/save.js` — localStorage save.
- `scripts/check.mjs` — plays the game in an emulated phone, 9 behaviour checks.

## Commands

- `npm run dev` — serves the folder on port 5173.
- `npm test` — unit tests (node:test).
- `npm run check` — behaviour checks (needs the dev server running).
